  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Ukraine&#xBF;s fast recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this action is for Ukraine to mitigate the impact of Russia&#xBF;s war of aggression on Ukraine&#xBF;s population. The budget support action aims at strengthening the means of the Government to carry out urgent rehabilitation of damaged critical priority objects, affected due to military aggression of the RF the recovery of which is necessary to prevent human disaster and significant displacement of people. This includes critical repairs of transport infrastructure such as ports, bridges, roads and railways, repairs of other critical and municipal infrastructure and utilities, rehabilitation of housing facilities and of social infrastructure such as school and kindergartens, healthcare facilities.The action will also contribute to the country&#xBF;s food security and economic resilience, including through supporting primary school nutrition programme and uninterrupted production of agricultural and food products and continue supporting the access of small farms (i.e. legal entities and individual agricultural producers) to working capital.</narrative>
  </description>
